          "sys_gu_master",
          "gu_continuing_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Shi Wu brings the spring egg Gu with Man Duo, prepares, then sends his primeval essence into lasting Gu and continuing Gu before injecting it into the spring egg Gu.",
